1
00:00:00,141 --> 00:00:03,411
(Howard:)slightly... bigger
cocktail umbrellas.

2
00:00:04,712 --> 00:00:06,282
(Leonard:)How is that a new invention?

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,680
(Howard:)I don't know, all Apple does
is change the size of things

4
00:00:08,683 --> 00:00:10,883
(Howard:)and we keep buying them.

5
00:00:10,885 --> 00:00:14,685
(Raj:)It's true. I like my giant iPad
and my little iPad

6
00:00:14,689 --> 00:00:18,159
(Raj:)almost as much
as my regular-sized iPad.

7
00:00:18,159 --> 00:00:20,389
(Sheldon:)This place is terrific.

8
00:00:20,394 --> 00:00:22,994
Why-why have
we never been here before?

9
00:00:22,997 --> 00:00:27,337
(Leonard:)The same reason we don't do
a lot of fun stuff... you.

10
00:00:27,335 --> 00:00:29,435
(Sheldon:)That's some smart talk
from a guy

11
00:00:29,437 --> 00:00:31,907
(Sheldon:)who can't even keep
his face in focus.

12
00:00:34,508 --> 00:00:36,738
(Sheldon:)Where's the bathroom?

13
00:00:36,744 --> 00:00:37,914
(Raj:)Uh, it's in the corner.

14
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:40,112
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

15
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:44,349
(Sheldon:)Hey, how you doin'?

16
00:00:46,387 --> 00:00:48,287
(Raj:)I hope the bathroom
is clearly marked.

17
00:00:48,289 --> 00:00:49,419
(Leonard:)Doesn't matter.

18
00:00:49,423 --> 00:00:51,723
(Leonard:)He's headed
for the kitchen anyway.

19
00:00:52,626 --> 00:00:53,756
(Howard:)Maybe that's an idea...

20
00:00:53,761 --> 00:00:56,331
(Howard:)guidance systems
for drunk people.

21
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:58,630
(Raj:)They have that.
It's called Uber.

22
00:00:58,632 --> 00:01:00,022
(Leonard:)Hey.

